CREATED:20261002T174214Z
DESCRIPTION:Please see the Vinkopletyny page for full details. Key informat
 ion:\n\nTimings: We will meet at Kazimir's family home (28 Beaconsfield Roa
 d\, St Albans\, AL1 3RB\; 5 minutes from St Albans Station) to process to S
 t Saviour's Church (a 12-minute walk away) at 18:00. If you cannot join the
  procession\, or if the weather is poor\, please meet at St Saviour's Churc
 h (AL1 4DF) at 18:30. Taxis from St Michael's Manor take around 5 minutes a
 nd cost approximately £5.\nWhat to wear: Traditional or national dress from
  your own culture is warmly welcome\; alternatively we welcome Ukrainian cl
 othing in support of Ukraine. Otherwise\, please wear whatever is smart\, c
 omfortable and easy to dance in. See the Vinkopletyny page for more details
 .\nWhat to bring: Please bring a small\, meaningful ornament or decoration 
 to hang on the Ukrainian wedding tree (Hiltse).\nGetting home: Vinkopletyny
  will finish at 23:00. St Saviour's Church is a 10-minute walk from the tow
 n centre and St Albans Station\, or a 5-minute taxi journey (Uber/Bolt).
LAST-MODIFIED:20261004T165549Z
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:KM27 - Vinkopletyny
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-CREATOR-IDENTITY:com.apple.calendar
X-APPLE-CREATOR-TEAM-IDENTITY:0000000000
END:VEVENT
