DESCRIPTION:Please see the Ceremony page for full details. Key information:
 \n\nTimings: The ceremony begins at 13:30. Please arrive by 13:00 so all gu
 ests can be seated by 13:15.\nGetting to the ceremony: St Albans Cathedral 
 is a 20-minute walk from St Albans City Station or a 5-minute taxi ride. Pa
 rking at the Cathedral is limited.\nWhat to wear: Formal attire. We recomme
 nd suits\, cocktail dresses\, or equivalent formal wear. If your shoes are 
 not made for dancing\, you may wish to bring a more comfortable pair for th
 e evening.\nWill any part be outdoors? Yes. Part of the reception will take
  place outdoors.
